{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 15,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        139.0904998779297,
        57.98431396484375,
        314.4745178222656,
        84.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "Executive summary",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.1357879638672,
        399.0728454589844,
        203.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "Clinical care at first-referral hospitals in low-income countries is often provided by",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        203.1357879638672,
        399.1027526855469,
        216.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "nurses, paramedical workers, and non-specialist general doctors with very limited",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        216.1357879638672,
        399.05279541015625,
        229.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "resources. There is often inadequate support from the central level, poor access to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        229.1357879638672,
        399.1229553222656,
        242.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "information, little ongoing professional development or staff training, and most",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        242.0057830810547,
        399.1117248535156,
        255.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "Pocket Book of Hospital Care for Children often low staff morale. The WHO   was",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        255.1357879638672,
        399.0628356933594,
        268.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "first published in 2005 to provide clinical guidance for the management of common",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        268.1357727050781,
        399.1128845214844,
        281.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "childhood illnesses and to improve quality of care in first-referral hospitals in these",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        281.1357727050781,
        399.1328125,
        294.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "settings. Since then, new evidence has emerged and there have been changes to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        294.1357727050781,
        309.77288818359375,
        307.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "several WHO guidelines requiring update of the Pocket Book.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        307.00579833984375,
        399.1256408691406,
        320.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "Handbook for Guideline Development In line with the current WHO  , key chapters",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        320.00579833984375,
        399.1188049316406,
        333.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "Pocket Book in the   were reviewed and clinical recommendations that required",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        333.1357727050781,
        399.0527648925781,
        346.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "updating in view of the current evidence were identified. These were prioritized by the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        346.1357727050781,
        399.102783203125,
        359.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines Steering Committee through a consultative process with regional offices",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        359.1357727050781,
        399.15289306640625,
        372.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "and implementation of the Pocket Book by external experts in an effort to identify",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        372.1357727050781,
        399.15283203125,
        385.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "gaps, new evidence, or changes to clinical practice that required updating. Several",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        385.1357727050781,
        399.0929260253906,
        398.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "sections were identified as having priority and included management of common",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        398.1357727050781,
        399.07275390625,
        411.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "causes of fever (acute and chronic otitis media, typhoid fever and meningitis);",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        411.1357727050781,
        399.1428527832031,
        424.62579345703125
      ],
      "text": "treatment of acute respiratory infections; treatment of dysentery; use of antibiotics",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        424.13580322265625,
        399.0729675292969,
        437.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "in cases with severe acute malnutrition (SAM); and management of several common",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        437.13580322265625,
        399.0529479980469,
        450.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "neonatal conditions. These priority areas were the basis of the evidence review, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        450.13580322265625,
        310.8629455566406,
        463.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "synthesis and development of these revised recommendations.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        463.13580322265625,
        396.8504943847656,
        476.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "The development of the recommendations followed the WHO guideline develop­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        476.13580322265625,
        399.1128234863281,
        489.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "ment process and involved identification of review questions, retrieval of up-to-date",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        489.13580322265625,
        396.8504943847656,
        502.6258239746094
      ],
      "text": "relevant evidence, assessment and synthesis of the evidence, formulation and exter­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        502.13580322265625,
        396.8504943847656,
        515.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "nal review of the recommendations, and discussion on dissemination, implementa­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        515.1358032226562,
        233.21295166015625,
        528.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "tion and regular updating of the guidelines.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        528.1358032226562,
        399.0916442871094,
        541.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "The scientific evidence for the recommendations was synthesized using the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        541.1358032226562,
        399.0928649902344,
        554.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "Grading of Recommendations Assessment, Development and Evaluation (GRADE)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        554.1358032226562,
        399.06280517578125,
        567.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "methodology. For each preselected priority question, evidence profiles were prepared",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        567.1358032226562,
        399.1229553222656,
        580.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "based on up-to-date systematic reviews. The recommendations were formulated,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        580.1358032226562,
        399.0828552246094,
        593.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "peer reviewed and agreed on by consensus during the Guidelines Development",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        593.1358032226562,
        399.06280517578125,
        606.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "Group (GDG) meeting held in Geneva, Switzerland, on 14–17 February 2011.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        606.1358032226562,
        399.122802734375,
        619.6257934570312
      ],
      "text": "The group assessed the available evidence and, by consensus, made a total of 50",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        225.52369689941406,
        644.9403076171875,
        229.5196990966797,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "1",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}